  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI) - InsurePay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Insurepay plans to reach 1000 farmers in the eastern province of Zambia, initially providing loans to 300 of them in the first year. This project will also train farmers in financial literacy, mobile money, record keeping, and financial skills that will help them grow and scale their farming activities.</narrative>
  </description>
